it  down the middle one half of her face is  solid black with a green eye and the  other half is orange striped with a blue  her famous tagline is 0% Photoshop 100%  foreign this way but how is it possible  that this cat is real people believe  that she may have contained two  different types of DNA but it turns out  it was all just luck how cool is that  Beach runway if you think this is a  screenshot from the next blockbuster  movie you are wrong this is no joke and  if you don't believe us  just take a trip to the Caribbean island  of st. Maarten and visit the Maho beach  it is located directly next to the  Princess Juliana International Airport  tourists from around the world gather  for the experience of a lifetime most of  the restaurants and bars even display  the daily arrivals and departures  airline timetables  the planes fly but only meters from  their heads and if you don't hold on to  your stuff or even yourself you could be  blown away by the immense jet force I  guess that's one way to dry yourself off  Goat tree these goats are not a product  of a funny Photoshop prank and no they  are not excitedly pretending to be  Christmas ornaments the goats really are  standing on the branches of an argan 'ya  tree PR Jennea is a rare and protected  species of tree that is grown almost  exclusively in Morocco the tree produces  an incredibly delicious fruit that  attracts tons of goats and other hungry  animals they swarm to the Argan 'ya  branches and go to great lengths to  reach the sweet fruit how far would you  go for your favorite tasty snack Haku  the fish this fish caught the attention  of many people when it began turning up  in rivers and lakes across the US and  it's easy to see why it might be hard to  believe but this image has not been  tampered with this fish is known as a  PACU fish and really does have human  looking teeth the PACU is a native of  the Amazon River in South America and is  a close relative of the piranha much  like humans apophis teeth are mostly  used to grind down food their powerful  jaws and teeth are great for cracking  nuts that fall from trees but we still  wouldn't want them taking a bite of our  ankles the crooked house this  wonderfully wonky structure looks like  someone was having a little too much fun  in Photoshop this adorable house is  called chef Adamic which translates into  Crooked House it is located in sulphate  Poland and was built by a design team  known as a tin ski and Zaleski in 2004  the 4000 square metre commercial  building is attached to a shopping  centre tourists constantly flocked to  see one of the world's strangest  buildings Crooked House was built to  honour the children's book and fairy  tale book illustrations by Yann Shan sir  we love this real-life fairy tale  building don't you floating whale this  floating creature would be the last  thing on your mind when you and your  friends go to the beach sure you expect  seaweed to attack you or someone to dive  under the water and grab your foot  pretending to be a sea monster but you  definitely don't expect the largest  mammal in the ocean to surf to the shore  with you what this crowd and you are  witnessing is a disease whale floating  close to the shore be careful though you  might just get chunks of whale blubber  on you because whales are known to  explode due to the large amounts of gas  buildup band of ants all right so out of  all the photos so far this one is  definitely the most out there for  unbelievable what a colony of ants  banded together to unscrew a soda cap  and place a straw inside and if so how  could anyone happen to be in the right  place at the right time to snap this pic  this has to be a heavily CGI'd Superbowl  commercial right wrong this is actually  the mastermind of Andre Pavlov a former  set designer for the entertainment  industry he designed this incredible set  piece along with many others so he could  interact with the ants and snap these  award-winning shots seeing ants work  together at this scale is awe-inspiring  to Andre and we agree  motorcycle surfing this image is a bad  attempt at a clearly photoshopped image  surfing with a dirt bike seems as  impossible as this image don't you think  believe it or not this extreme image is  no optical illusion or computer trick it  is a product of professional motorbike  rider and  runnin junkie Robbie Maddison he is  known for pushing boundaries like  jumping across an open Tower Bridge in  London and jumping the Arc de Triomphe  replica in Las Vegas in the spirit of  pushing boundaries he bolted ski  attachments on his dirtbike and tackle  the ocean waves pretty unbelievable  isn't it  which of these photos did you find hard  to believe leave us a comment down below  and let us know if you'd like to see  more cool videos like this one don't  forget to subscribe to the things thanks  for watching  [Music]  you

